[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18061.99, "timestamp": "05:01:01", "text": "把所有东西都拿走。是的。向下。向下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18065.43, "timestamp": "05:01:05", "text": "向下。我得到了它。带上你的东西。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18067.35, "timestamp": "05:01:07", "text": "你姐姐去世了。姐姐去世了。我们开始吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18073.03, "timestamp": "05:01:13", "text": "你的东西都在这里。我点击"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18077.19, "timestamp": "05:01:17", "text": "东西。这些都是你的东西。这里的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18079.19, "timestamp": "05:01:19", "text": "哦，这边有东西。有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18082.07, "timestamp": "05:01:22", "text": "我们的东西都放在树林中间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18089.83, "timestamp": "05:01:29", "text": "买些东西。是的。把所有东西都拿走。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18092.23, "timestamp": "05:01:32", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18095.51, "timestamp": "05:01:35", "text": "这边。把东西捡起来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18103.11, "timestamp": "05:01:43", "text": "谁需要治愈？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18106.39, "timestamp": "05:01:46", "text": "我需要疗愈。大量的疗愈效果。感谢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18109.99, "timestamp": "05:01:49", "text": "你。我也是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18112.868, "timestamp": "05:01:52", "text": "真是见鬼了。每个人都需要疗愈。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18115.51, "timestamp": "05:01:55", "text": "那太糟糕了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18118.47, "timestamp": "05:01:58", "text": "谢谢您，参议员。好的，没问题。患病的"}]